OL,6,
OL,7,FHelicopter footage shows robots
OL,8,Fapproaching vans at the scene
OL,10,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,11,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,12,Fmilitary, as the country's Air Force
OL,13,Fsay they "remain vigilant" following
OL,14,Fthe incident
